  location: "약초꾼의 쉼터"
  background: {fileID: 0}
  backgroundTexture: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 3bef652f35f44da6aa9330e3a4373ba7, type: 3}
  backgroundUv: {serializedVersion: 2, x: 0.355, y: 0.33906250000000004, width: 0.5, height: 0.421875}
  lines:
  - speaker: "약초꾼"
    text: "흑운협이 다시 열렸다면 아래 마을들이 위험하겠군. 네 사부는 과거 그곳의 피란민들을 구한 사람이야."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 1
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 69317ef1716d4a58aa82b48616a79755, type: 2}
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    voiceEnvelope: []
    videoSpeechTrack: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: "약초꾼"
    text: "닮은 사람은 돌가루 묻은 채석장 길로 갔어. 동쪽에는 다른 포로들이, 서쪽에는 추포대가 갔지."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 1
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 69317ef1716d4a58aa82b48616a79755, type: 2}
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    voiceEnvelope: []
    videoSpeechTrack: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: "청운"
    text: "사부님 외에도 붙잡힌 사람들이 있군요."
    leftPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    rightPortrait: {fileID: 0}
    speakerOnRight: 0
    leftActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 785c8ad844794d05b385c0ee103179fe, type: 2}
    rightActor: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 69317ef1716d4a58aa82b48616a79755, type: 2}
